<title>CANADA: Canada daily lumber export figures to U.S..</title>
<headline>Canada daily lumber export figures to U.S..</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada softwood lumber exports to the United States as of 0001 EST on December 30 in board feet, according to data from the Canadian Department of Foreign Affairs and International Trade:</p>
<p>		   For the Oct 1 - Dec 31 quarter:</p>
<p>Province   BC     Alberta     Ontario    Quebec    Total</p>
<p>bonus    5.00 million  6.83 million   8.31 million  43.35 million 63.49 million</p>
<p>EB	 1.85 bln 251.5 million  357.1 million  767.9 million  3.23 bln</p>
<p>LFB	0.77 million  1.36 million   0.38 million   4.71 million  7.22 million</p>
<p>UFB	0.04 million  ---	  2.55 million   6.06 million  8.65 million</p>
